{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17245","headline":"寄临海郡崔穉璋 · 权德舆","name":"寄临海郡崔穉璋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美酒步兵厨，古人尝宦游。\n赤城临海峤，君子今督邮。\n吏隐丰暇日，琴壶共冥搜。\n新诗寒玉韵，旷思孤云秋。\n志士诚勇退，鄙夫自包羞。\n终当就知己，莫恋潺湲流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}